  "bio": "Renowned for her impressive proficiency in the 'realism' style, Lisa McIntyre is a highly skilled tattoo artist based at Chameleon Tattoo in Paisley, Scotland. Her dedication to her craft is evident in every piece of art she creates, ensuring each tattoo is a true masterpiece. Clients rave about Lisa's work, often highlighting the meticulous attention to detail and the incredible life-like quality of her tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattooist at Chameleon Tattoo. Paisley, Scotland 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿\n@lisa_mcintyre_art - painting, illustration, artwork\nEmail - lisatattoochameleon@hotmail.com\n\nTattooist at Chameleon Tattoo. Paisley, Scotland 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿\n@lisa_mcintyre_art - painting, illustration, artwork\nEmail - lisatattoochameleon@hotmail.com",
